cal pharmacology 88(9):4142–4154</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1111/bcp.15339\">10.1111/bcp.15339</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35357027\">35357027</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Melhem_2022: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
